+/**
+ * Input tokens one step read, or null when the record is not a step measurement.
+ *
+ * Only `usage.record` counts. The same step is also written to
+ * `context.append_loop_event` as `step.end`, carrying an identical `usage`
+ * object, so tallying both would double every step. A record scoped to the
+ * session reports a running total rather than one step, so it is skipped too.
+ */
